|---|---|
| Flutter engine, framework, Dart SDK, Skia | BSD-3-Clause |
| Everything vendored beneath them | see `LICENSE.engine` |
| Roboto (`Roboto-Regular.ttf`, shipped in the engine artifact) | Apache-2.0 |
| VitaSDK headers and stub libraries | see the VitaSDK distribution; not redistributed here |

This project vendors no third-party source. `third_party/` is checked out by
tooling and is not committed; the exact revisions are pinned in
[VERSIONS.md](VERSIONS.md) and the modifications are in [patches/](patches/).
